   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNICEF Project Norr</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF Project North</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till UNICEF:s utbildningsprogram i Afghanistan. Syftet &#xe4;r att bidra till &#xf6;kad andel flickor inskrivna i grundskolan och &#xf6;kad l&#xe4;skunnighet hos kvinnor i &#xe5;ldrarna 15-49 &#xe5;r. Detta kommer att ske genom st&#xf6;d till sektorreform, &#xf6;ka kvaliteten i grundskolan med s&#xe4;rskilt fokus p&#xe5; flickor och kvinnor. Projektet fokuserar p&#xe5; de norra provinserna d&#xe4;r det svenska PRT verkar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of UNICEF&apos;s &quot;Basic Education &amp; Gender Equality&quot; programme is to contribute to increased primary school enrolment for girls, and increased literacy rates of females in the ages 15-49 years. This will be done through support to sector reform and community  development, increase the quality of primary education with special focus on girls and women. The project focuses on 4 norhtern provinces</narrative>
  </description>
